# Deploy ops (path-scoped)

- Deploy status/preflight routes are **read-only** — no infra provisioning or onchain mutation as side effect.
- Use epoch scripts: `run-greenfield-cutover`, `validate-greenfield-handoff`, `sync-greenfield-env-from-handoff`.
- `msg.sender` / ERC-4337 sender must match execution track (user CSW vs deploy-session vs protocol CSW).
- Regenerate bytecode manifests and re-seed `UniversalBytecodeStore` after lane-neutral contract changes.
- Addresses SSoT: `docs/reference/addresses.md`, `contracts.defaults.ts`.

Runbook detail: `docs/agent-context/archives/deploy-cutovers.md`. Template: `.cursor/commands/deploy-cutover.md`.

Validate: `pnpm -C frontend validate:deploy-guards`
